# 只发送统一镜像所需文件，禁止把凭据、测试数据、Git 和前端依赖送入构建上下文。
**
!docker/
!docker/go-judge/
!docker/go-judge/Dockerfile
!docker/go-judge/packages.lock
!docker/go-judge/mount.yaml
!docker/go-judge/*.py
!docker/web/
!docker/web/*.py
!docker/frontend/
!docker/frontend/Dockerfile
!docker/frontend/nginx.conf
!ymcloud-judge/
!ymcloud-judge/src/
!ymcloud-judge/src/main/
!ymcloud-judge/src/main/c/
!ymcloud-judge/src/main/c/*.c
!ymcloud-judge/target/
!ymcloud-judge/target/ymcloud-judge.jar
!ymcloud-web/
!ymcloud-web/target/
!ymcloud-web/target/ymcloud-web.jar
!ymcloud-vue/
!ymcloud-vue/dist/
!ymcloud-vue/dist/**
